PHASE 3 — THE COLLISION: `until:{letter}` and `until:{threat}` still work as explicit WAITS
==============================================================================
The wake and the matchers fire on the SAME journal row. The caller's
name has to win, or an advance armed `until:{threat}` comes back
`reason:"letter"` and every consumer branching on that token breaks
SILENTLY — it stopped at the same tick on the same event.
